            "review_title": "Review at Hongkie's By Kong 72",
            "review_text": "Travel10725905980\n2 contributions\n1\nHidden Treasure in Da Nang\nApr 2024 • Friends\nAs a Honkie travelling to Danang , I was told this is THE PLACE to visit for dim sum . It’s so true! The food was authentic, the flavours were so good , and the venue was chic and relaxing at the same time. I’ll definitely be back again. Highly recommend if you want to get a dim sum fix !\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 26, 2024",
